ails, with a fallback for popup blockers, triggering a link in the current window. A feedback dialog is displayed, showing the order ID and WhatsApp link within the modal. A notification indicates that WhatsApp is being opened, while re-enabling the confirmation button for reuse.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Lenovo\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\brew-and-bloom\\\\script.js\"","EndLine":"430","StartLine":"395","toolAction":"\"Reading openCheckoutModal in script.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Inspect openCheckoutModal implementation\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
